# The kit is plain JavaScript (the Python core went 2026-10-08). Build output: Quasar's dist/ in
# the template, Gradle's own ignores under src-capacitor/android/; template/build/ is tracked —
# it holds the headless launcher (app-structure.md §Q.3).
dist/
node_modules/

# docgen (just-ai-i18n-docgen) — the translation tool's machine state for the kit's catalog (the
# lines its Setup page prints); config.json and *.accepted.json / *.notes.json are committed.
ui/just-ai-i18n-docgen/*.probe.json
ui/just-ai-i18n-docgen/.just-ai-i18n-docgen-cache.json
ui/just-ai-i18n-docgen/.just-ai-i18n-docgen-probe-cache.json
ui/just-ai-i18n-docgen/.just-ai-i18n-docgen-state.json
